    "description": "Poojara Telecom is actively seeking a talented and motivated Floor Manager to join our dynamic team in Noida. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Poojara Telecom:\nPoojara Telecom is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n• Manage store operations to ensure smooth daily functioning\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Assist in recruiting, onboarding, and performance management of staff\n• Manage shrinkage and reduce stock discrepancies\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Shrinkage Control\n• Proficiency in POS Systems\n• Proficiency in Visual Merchandising\n• Proficiency in Customer Service\n• Proficiency in Omnichannel Retail\n• Proficiency in Team Leadership\n• Proficiency in E-commerce Integration\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Poojara Telecom!",
